5.2. Installing, configuring and running the Program in one's own environment, as documented, is
     not modification.
5.3. This licence transfers neither ownership of the Program nor any trademark rights.

6. CITATION
6.1. Any work resulting from authorized Use in research must cite the Program as set out in the
     CITATION.cff file in this repository, with its name, version and URL.

7. USER DATA AND RESULTS
7.1. The Program runs in the user's environment. Input data and the results produced belong to
