SUMMARY IN ENGLISH (the Portuguese text below prevails)
  • Personal use and use in teaching: free of charge, no permission needed.
  • Use in research: allowed only with the author's PRIOR WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION, by e-mail.
  • Commercial use: not allowed.
